            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000006",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In the bustling central district of Sigala, Hurghada Marina stands as a testament to modernity and sophistication. This marina, a fusion of chic ambiance and nautical grace, has rapidly become the heart of Hurghada’s dining and social scene. As the sun dips below the horizon, the marina transforms into a vibrant promenade, inviting visitors to relish the evening ambiance and indulge in "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000003"
              ],
              "text": "culinary delights"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " at its numerous cafes and restaurants."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/hurghada-travel-guide/culinary-delights/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/hurghada/what-to-eat-in-hurghada",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A Landmark Project"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000010",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000a"
              ],
              "text": "Hurghada"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Marina is not just a leisure spot; it’s a significant architectural marvel in Hurghada. Designed by the renowned Sorgreah Consultants of France and with consultancy services provided by ASA consultants in "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000d"
              ],
              "text": "Egypt"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", the marina represents one of the most ambitious and spectacular projects in the city."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/group-tour-luxor-hurghada/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/luxor-highlights-group-day-tour-from-hurghada",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/contact-us/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/contact",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000012",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A Hub of Luxury and Leisure"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "More than just a haven for yachts, Hurghada Marina has earned acclaim for its exclusive selection of bars and eateries, a wide array of designer boutiques, and "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000014"
              ],
              "text": "luxurious"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " holiday apartments encircling the port. It’s a "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000017"
              ],
              "text": "place where elegance"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " meets relaxation, offering an escape into a world of refined leisure."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/experiencing-egypt-aboard-the-oberoi-zahra/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/blog/oberoizafura-de-nairu-o-tabi-suru",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
