              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/authentic-dahabiya-nile-cruise",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Marina Harbor Facilities"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000021",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Marina Harbor is equipped to accommodate 200 yachts, ranging from modest 10-meter boats to grand 100-meter megayachts, which can be moored along the seaward side of the main dock. The infrastructure is meticulously planned to provide comprehensive services for various types of vessels, ensuring a seamless "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001e"
              ],
              "text": "experience for sea travelers"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/hurghada-private-day-tours/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/hurghada/hurghada-private-day-tours",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000023",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Dining with a View"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000028",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Dining at Hurghada Marina is an experience in itself. With a backdrop of gently bobbing yachts and the vast "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000025"
              ],
              "text": "Red Sea"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " stretching into the horizon, each meal here is more than just food; it’s a feast for the senses."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://www.britannica.com/place/Red-Sea",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000029",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Location"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000002b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Situated on the Hurghada Marina Promenade in Sigala, this marina is not just a destination but a "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002c"
              ],
              "text": "journey into the heart"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " of Hurghada’s contemporary charm and seaside allure."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000002c",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
