          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000023",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Instalaciones del puerto deportivo"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002e",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El puerto deportivo está equipado para albergar 200 yates, desde modestas embarcaciones de 10 metros hasta grandes megayates de 100 metros, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000026"
              ],
              "text": "que pueden amarrarse a lo largo del"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000028",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " muelle principal."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000029",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " La infraestructura está meticulosamente planificada para ofrecer servicios integrales a diversos tipos de embarcaciones, garantizando una "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002b"
              ],
              "text": "experiencia sin contratiempos a los viajeros por"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " mar. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
